*> USING data (64 bytes), available byte count (BINARY-LONG), position (BINARY-LONG, 0-based, moved past
*> the VarInt), value out (BINARY-LONG): reads the VarInt at the position of the area. One that is not
*> complete within the available bytes, goes on after 5 bytes or is above 2147483647 (no particle
*> option field is negative) gives -1 and leaves the position alone.
