     MOVE L-POSITION TO WS-START
     MOVE 1 TO WS-WEIGHT
     MOVE 0 TO WS-SUM
     MOVE 0 TO WS-DONE
     PERFORM VARYING WS-STEP FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-STEP > 5 OR WS-DONE NOT = 0
         COMPUTE WS-INDEX = L-POSITION + 1
         IF WS-INDEX > L-AVAILABLE
             MOVE 2 TO WS-DONE
         ELSE
             COMPUTE WS-BYTE = FUNCTION ORD(L-DATA(WS-INDEX:1)) - 1
