*> USING PB-BUFFER, PB-LOGIN, PB-SPAWN-INFO (05a 0x32): Int entity id, Boolean hardcore, VarInt count
*> and Identifiers of the dimension names, VarInt max players, view distance and simulation distance,
*> Booleans reduced debug info, show death screen and limited crafting, the spawn info, Booleans
*> online mode and enforces secure chat. A count outside 0 to PB-LG-MAX-DIMENSIONS, a negative
*> VarInt field, a flag outside 0 or 1, an invalid identifier or a spawn info PB-PUT-SPAWN-INFO
*> rejects is an error; nothing is appended.
 DATA DIVISION.
 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
 01 WS-START               BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-I                   BINARY-LONG.
 LINKAGE SECTION.
 COPY PROTO.
 COPY PBLEVEL.
 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING PB-BUFFER PB-LOGIN PB-SPAWN-INFO.
     IF PB-LG-HARDCORE < 0 OR PB-LG-HARDCORE > 1 OR PB-LG-DIM-COUNT < 0
             OR PB-LG-DIM-COUNT > PB-LG-MAX-DIMENSIONS
             OR PB-LG-MAX-PLAYERS < 0 OR PB-LG-VIEW-DISTANCE < 0 OR PB-LG-SIM-DISTANCE < 0
             OR PB-LG-REDUCED-DEBUG < 0 OR PB-LG-REDUCED-DEBUG > 1
             OR PB-LG-DEATH-SCREEN < 0 OR PB-LG-DEATH-SCREEN > 1
             OR PB-LG-LIMITED-CRAFT < 0 OR PB-LG-LIMITED-CRAFT > 1
